
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout titulo="Inicio | Proyecto ASIR">

  <section class="presentacion">

    <h1>Blog de Sistemas</h1>

    <p>
      Bienvenido a mi proyecto ASIR centrado en administración de sistemas,
      redes, servidores y seguridad.
    </p>

  </section>

  <section class="secciones">

    <div class="tarjeta">

      <h2>Linux</h2>
      <p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="tarjeta">

      <h2>Servidores</h2>
      <p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book..</p>

    </div>

    <div class="tarjeta">

      <h2>Redes</h2>
      <p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.</p>

    </div>

  </section>

   <section class="noticias">

  <h2>Noticias Tecnológicas</h2>

  <div id="contenedor_noticias" class="lista_noticias">

    <p>Cargando noticias...</p>

  </div>

  </section>

<script is:inline>

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', async () => {
    const contenedor = document.getElementById('contenedor_noticias');

    try {
      const respuesta = await fetch('/noticias.php');
      const datos = await respuesta.json();

      contenedor.innerHTML = '';

      datos.articles.forEach((noticia) => {
        const tarjeta = document.createElement('div');
        tarjeta.classList.add('tarjeta');

        tarjeta.innerHTML = `
          <h3>${noticia.title}</h3>
          <p>${noticia.description}</p>
          <a href="${noticia.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Leer más</a>
        `;

        contenedor.appendChild(tarjeta);
      });
    } catch (error) {
      contenedor.innerHTML = '<p>No se pudieron cargar las noticias en este momento.</p>';
    }
  });

</script>

</Layout>

<style>

  .presentacion {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .secciones {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .tarjeta {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #dddddd;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .tarjeta h2,
  .tarjeta h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .noticias {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .lista_noticias {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

</style>


